---
smd: 2
title: Rule chains
---

## Work

:::requirement{#R1}
Ship the export.
:::

- [ ] Wire the export job :depends[R6] {#T1}

## Rules

:::constraint{#C1 applies-to=R1 depends-on=R2}
The export reads from the archive.
:::

:::constraint{#C3 applies-to=R2 depends-on=R3}
The archive is encrypted at rest.
:::

:::constraint{#C4 applies-to=R3 depends-on=R4}
Keys rotate every quarter.
:::

:::constraint{#C5 applies-to=R4}
Rotation is logged.
:::

:::constraint{#C9 applies-to=R9}
Unrelated rule.
:::

## Store

:::requirement{#R2}
Keep an archive.
:::

:::requirement{#R3}
Encrypt the archive.
:::

:::requirement{#R4}
Rotate keys.
:::

:::requirement{#R6}
Schedule jobs.
:::

:::requirement{#R9}
Something else.
:::

:::constraint{#CSTORE}
Archive jobs run off-peak.
:::
